WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:03.390
The evening of 11 January 2007.

00:03.835 --> 00:16.296
Fengyun-1C, a retired Chinese weather satellite of 960 kg, circles the Earth over the poles, 845 to 865 km up.

00:16.810 --> 00:19.719
A missile launched from near Xichang is climbing to meet it.

00:20.374 --> 00:23.454
Its path was never published, so it is not drawn.
